        "uuid": "d24be94b_38448ebb",
        "filename": "python3-whitebox-tests-tempest.spec",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 51,
      "author": {
        "id": 265
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-15T16:11:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do use it, but tempest pulls it it for us. I guess since we have python3-tempst here as well, we don\u0027t need to list those?\n\nFor the record, we removed tempest and olso.log from our requirements.txt because we wanted to enable the case of installing tempest from RPM, but whitebox from pip.\n\nIn any case, I\u0027ve removed these two lines.",
      "parentUuid": "55520655_de16cfd3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 51,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "806b5ad76883fbc7df2216d47dbb64540923f026",
