    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "042f485a_a63f2ac0",
        "filename": "python3-whitebox-tests-tempest.spec",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 51,
      "author": {
        "id": 128
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-17T09:10:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we shouldn\u0027t trust in indirect requires. If a python module is imported in the project, it should be explicitly included as requirement in the rpm.\n\nWRT removing them from requirements.txt. I have no the whole context but I\u0027d say it\u0027s a bit strange that you mix rpms and pip in upstream jobs. Don\u0027t you test it in devstack or other non-rpm installations?. I\u0027d say it breaks a bit the upstream concept of managing dependencies via requirements project and testing oslo libraries updates via reviews to upper-constraints.txt.",
      "parentUuid": "d24be94b_38448ebb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 51,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "806b5ad76883fbc7df2216d47dbb64540923f026",
      "serverId": "270e2033-b340-4cff-9539-693957ebf0e7",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6126de84_e8b1e604",
        "filename": "python3-whitebox-tests-tempest.spec",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 51,
      "author": {
        "id": 265
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-17T15:51:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Upstream jobs are pure devstack, and use only pip.\n\n*Downstream* jobs install tempest from RPM, but because so far whitebox is not packaged, install whitebox from pip.\n\nI\u0027ve proposed a patch to improve/clarify our upstream requirements here: https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/whitebox-tempest-plugin/+/767573\n\nI\u0027m going to use that to propose a new version of this .spec patch.",
      "parentUuid": "042f485a_a63f2ac0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 51,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "806b5ad76883fbc7df2216d47dbb64540923f026",
      "serverId": "270e2033-b340-4cff-9539-693957ebf0e7",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
